text = "On the other hand, it’s not small.
And I think there’s just one line you need to understand to use it properly. The safe expects you to get the logic. But I know you can do it—you’ve got what it takes!
We’re just going to talk about indexes and “char”. It’s simple:
if we have the string “ozcfgh” and you're asked for the “character at index” where index is 3, you're actually being asked for “f”. Because:
_______________________________
Characters | o | z | c | f  | g | h
Indexes      | 0 | 1 | 2 | 3 | 4 | 5
_______________________________"
autowrap_mode = 3

